1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,310
My dad's been gone sixteen years.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:04,440
I still fill his truck's tank.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,670
And every month, it's empty.

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:09,040
A hundred and fifty gallons.

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,580
The truck never leaves the barn.

6
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,900
My wife said someone's stealing it.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,040
So I put a lock on the cap.

8
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,540
Empty again.

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,880
Then a stranger's letter came.

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,606
"Your dad saved my life.

11
00:00:22,606 --> 00:00:24,112
Blizzard on I-80.

12
00:00:24,112 --> 00:00:25,530
My tank was dry.

13
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,231
He filled it.

14
00:00:27,231 --> 00:00:29,010
Wouldn't take a dime.

15
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,170
Said his boy keeps it full."

16
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:33,650
The letter was dated last week.
